BottleMusic uses the MiSans font family in its application interface.

The bundled MiSans-Regular.ttf, MiSans-Medium.ttf, MiSans-Demibold.ttf and
MiSans-Bold.ttf each identify themselves as Version 2.000 in the OpenType
name table, with head.fontRevision 2.0 and 29093 glyphs. BottleMusic retains
the supplied font files without editing or subsetting them.

Copyright notice retained in all four font files:
Copyright (c)  2020-2021  Beijing Xiaomi Mobile Software Co.,Ltd. All Rights Reserved.
The font metadata identifies the manufacturer as Hanyi Fonts.

The complete official MiSans Font Intellectual Property License Agreement
is included, unchanged, as MiSans-License-Agreement.pdf. This notice records
the bundled files and does not replace that agreement. The fonts are
embedded in the BottleMusic application; they are not offered as a
standalone font distribution. The agreement permits use in applications
and requires the copyright notice and agreement to accompany font copies.

